	<text xml:lang="la">
		<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" subtype="metadata" n="1">Siehe oben S. 179, Anm. 2.</note>
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Summam foelicitatem per Christum tibi opto, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>fidelissime ac doctissime <persName ref="p2836">Heinryche</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z3"/>Praeteritis diebus ad te scripsi<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Siehe oben <ref target="file10154">Nr. 123</ref>.</note>, in quanta perturbatione sit respublica in <placeName ref="l2480">Reni valle</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Quapropter iam supersedebo <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>de illa plura scribere, et quod ad me pertinet, oro, ne graveris audire, ut et facis.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Die vicesima<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a"><hi>in der Vorlage</hi> vigesirna.</note> augusti <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>pręses noster<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">Landvogt <persName ref="p19012">Götschi Z'Hag</persName> von <placeName ref="l801">Zug</placeName>, s. oben <ref target="file10154">[Nr. 123]</ref> S. 179, Anm. 6.</note> nuncium ad me misit, ut ad eum veniam in <placeName ref="l1047">Bernang</placeName><note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Alter Name für <placeName ref="l1047">Berneck</placeName> im unteren <placeName ref="l2480">Rheintal</placeName> <hi>(s.</hi> <bibl source="b291">HBLS</bibl> II 187f).</note>, cuius iussis obedivi et apparui <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>tempore constituto.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Eo autem cum suis harpygiis [!] me intuente in consistorio sic incepi fari, me iussu<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b"><hi>in der Vorlage</hi> iusu.</note> suo <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>iam adesse, spectare, quid velit.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Tunc sic me adloquutus est, me accusatum coram eo annotasse aliquos <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>articulos uni sacrificulo concionem habenti 15. die augusti contra sanccionem <placeName ref="l2542">7 cantonum</placeName><note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">Das Mandat betreffend die Geistlichen im <placeName ref="l2480">Rheintal</placeName> vom 10. Juli 1532, s. oben <ref target="file10154">[Nr. 123]</ref> S. 179, Anm. 3.</note> et sic me <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>reputatum foedifragum<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6">Vgl. auch die schon früher erhobenen Anklagen gegen <persName ref="p2836">Strübi</persName> (<bibl source="b197">EA</bibl> IV/1b 1373 i.).</note>.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Insuper quantis me flagitiis<note xml:id="fnc" type="footnote" n="c"><hi>in der Vorlage</hi> flagiis.</note> obnoxium ob has annotaciones esse intonuerit, iam non est dicendi <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>locus.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Ad hęc humilima voce respondi non novum esse me conciones adnotare; nam me ante novem <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>annos conciones et lectiones conscripsisse.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Denique novum non est.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Nam et illi nostras conscribunt.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Quid <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>autem colegissem per aliquos annos, demonstrabam illi codicillo dato.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Sed surdo fabulam narrabam<note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7">Siehe Adagia, 1,4,87 (<bibl source="b370">LB</bibl> II 178 C).</note>.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z13"/>Adeo obduratis auribus obnitebat [!].</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Ad hęc quoque adieci: Cum Christum nostrum salvatorem ebuccinat, nonne <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>merito scribi debet?</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Nam et ego illum meam<pb type="edition" next="189"/> salutem nosco.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Sin minus, necesse est resistere impietati.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z15"/>Hec et multa alia argumentabar, sed frustra.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Ad hec mea argumenta respondit necesse esse eos <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>omnes multo doctiores et peritiores esse rei evangelicę quam me et mei similes.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Quid multis?</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Reputabar <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>pro periuro.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Etiam ad me dixit, quis mihi potestatem dediderit concionandi vel legendi, cum non dediderim vel <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>promiserim per fide iussores<note xml:id="fnd" type="footnote" n="d">per fide iussores <hi>am Rande nachgetragen.</hi></note> 100 aureos<note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8">Zu der im oben erwähnten Mandat geforderten Bürgschaft s. oben <ref target="file10154">[Nr. 123]</ref> S. 179, Anm. 3.</note>.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Ad hęc respondi me nec predicasse nec legisse, sed tantum dominicam oracion<lb xml:id="p1z19"/>em<note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" ana="lex" n="9">Herrengebet, Vaterunser.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>orasse cum angelica salutacione<note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10">Englischer Gruß oder Ave Maria, das seit dem Spätmittelalter mit dem Vaterunser verbunden wurde, s. Josef Andreas <hi>Jungmann,</hi> in: LThK I 1141.</note> et symbulo apostolico<note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11">Das Apostolische Glaubensbekenntnis, s. John N. D. <hi>Kelly,</hi> in: LThK I 760-762.</note>, et ultimo subiunxi hanc oracionem et<note xml:id="fne" type="footnote" n="e"><hi>übergeschrieben.</hi></note> presidi demonstravi eam<note xml:id="fnf" type="footnote" n="f"><hi>übergeschrieben.</hi></note>, quam tu or<lb xml:id="p1z21"/>as concione habita.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Et hęc egi propter instantem necessitatem et quoque propter tria matrimonia, que habui <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>iis duabus dominicis, quae ritu ecclesiastico coniunxi.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Nam<note xml:id="fng" type="footnote" n="g"><hi>am Rande nachgetragen.</hi></note> saltem iis duobus dominicis diebus oraveram<note xml:id="fnh" type="footnote" n="h"><hi>am Rande nachgetragen.</hi></note>.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Sed ovis excusatio coram lupo<note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" n="12">Zum Bild vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Mt 10,16</ref></cit>.</note> frustra erat.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z23"/>Hęc sunt mea crimina, flagicia, scelera, dilectissime frater, quae admisi.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la">Ob haec me incusaturus est in <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>comitiis Ferenę [!] <placeName ref="l21">Thermopoli</placeName> futuris<note xml:id="fn13" type="footnote" n="13">Diese Tagsatzung in <placeName ref="l21">Baden</placeName> wurde nicht am St. Verenentag (1. September) sondern am 4. September 1532 eröffnet. Dabei wurde auch der Fall <persName ref="p2836">Strübis</persName> verhandelt (<bibl source="b197">EA</bibl> IV/1b 1402 bbb.).</note>.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la">Quapropter, pręstantissime <persName ref="p2836">Heinryche</persName>, tui muneris erit, nam et hoc <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>expecto et postulo, ut <placeName ref="l587">Tigurini</placeName> causam meam deffendant et omnium apud <placeName ref="l2480">Renivallanos</placeName> verbi ministrorum<note xml:id="fn14" type="footnote" n="14"><placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName> sprach sich auf dieser Tagsatzung für die Abschaffung des Mandats im <placeName ref="l2480">Rheintal</placeName> aus, drang aber nicht durch (<bibl source="b197">EA</bibl> IV/1b 1399 I.).</note>.</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z26"/>Nam ne orare nobis licet in ecclesia.</s>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la">Sed cum hortacione non egeas, ut superioribus literis scripsi<note xml:id="fn15" type="footnote" n="15">Siehe oben <ref target="file10154">Nr. 123</ref>.</note>, <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>non utor ea pluribus verbis et tibi mea studia, officia, curas, cogitaciones committo<note xml:id="fni" type="footnote" n="i"><hi>in der Vorlage</hi> comito.</note>.</s>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la">Tibi enim existimo <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>tantum debere, quantum persolvere difficile est.</s>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="la">Res, cum hęc scribebam, erat in extremum deducta discrimen.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="33" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell"><lb xml:id="p1z29"/>Vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="34" xml:lang="la">Raptim, die Bartolomei 1532.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="35" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z30"/><persName ref="p2836">Heinrychus Strüby</persName>, verbi dei indignus minister <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>in <placeName ref="l310">Marpach</placeName> apud <placeName ref="l2480">Renivallanos</placeName>, infimus tuus <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>minister et ex animo tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="36" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z33"/>Multę cavillaciones adhuc essent tibi scribendę nostri pręsidis, sed non multis te volui obtundere, ne sanctiss<lb xml:id="p1z34"/>imum tempus iis deliramentis te terere oporteret.</s>
					<s n="37" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="38" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Integerrimo ac pręstantissimo M. <persName ref="p495">Heinryc<lb xml:id="p2z2"/>ho Bullingero</persName>, ecclesiastę fidelissimo sanctę <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>ecclesię <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinę</placeName>, mihi in Christo dilectissimo fratri.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
</TEI>